&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end promotions systems&lt;/strong&gt;, from backend services to user-facing tools used by merchants and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement scalable backend services, working with technologies such as Kotlin and Python and Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop high-quality &lt;strong&gt;web applications using React&lt;/strong&gt;, focused on usability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of &lt;strong&gt;large, cross-team initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, driving them from ideation through planning, alignment, and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product, design, and business stakeholders to shape solutions and ensure successful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate effectively in &lt;strong&gt;ambiguous environments&lt;/strong&gt;, bringing structure, clarity, and momentum to complex problem spaces.&lt;/li&gt;
