&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;full-stack engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;, with a solid backend foundation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt; and building product-facing web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Kotlin, Python and or Go &lt;/strong&gt;in production environments is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to &lt;strong&gt;take ownership in ambiguous environments&lt;/strong&gt;, driving initiatives from idea to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading &lt;strong&gt;cross-team projects&lt;/strong&gt;, including planning, stakeholder alignment, and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, with the ability to gather feedback, handle differing perspectives, and align stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
