&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Wolt, this role gives you the opportunity to build products that are &lt;strong&gt;directly used by restaurants and brands to grow their business&lt;/strong&gt;. Promotions are one of the most visible and impactful levers on the platform, and your work will shape how merchants attract customers, drive sales, and optimize their performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work on a mix of &lt;strong&gt;backend systems and user-facing tools&lt;/strong&gt;, owning features end-to-end and seeing your work quickly go live across multiple markets. This is a role where you can &lt;strong&gt;build, ship, and iterate fast&lt;/strong&gt;, while still tackling meaningful challenges around scale, usability, and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a strong sense of &lt;strong&gt;ownership and autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;, where engineers are trusted to drive solutions, influence product decisions, and take ideas from concept to production.&lt;/p&gt;
