&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Understand the developer experience and what it takes to magnify the output of engineers across the whole org.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;qu

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer II, Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Belfast, NI / Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(This role requires working in-office 3 days per week.)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EverQuote is a leading AI-powered growth solutions partner for regulated property and casualty insurance entities, enabling the largest insurance carriers and thousands of agents to maximize customer acquisition across digital channels. Fueled by our proprietary data assets and our AI traffic engine, EverQuote is transforming the way providers attract and engage consumers to grow market share.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining our team puts you at the forefront of this transformation. You will collaborate with a group of builders to solve complex problems and reshape a massive industry. If you want to drive real-world impact and do the best work of your career, you’ve found your home. We move fast, follow the data, and hold ourselves to high standards. If that&#39;s how you work too, this is the role for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EverQuote NI is seeking a Software Engineer II, Security to join our team! In this role, you will join a team that bridges the gap between Security Engineering and Compliance to streamline vulnerability management. You will work proactively to maintain a security testing process that enables Product and Engineering teams to provide business value in a secure environment. As a senior engineer, you will be an important member of the team and instrumental in the design and delivery of key business applications and solutions. You will have input in architecture decision-making within the team and ensure we build scalable, performant, easy to maintain and cost-optimised solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and trialling new security tooling for our SDLC, particularly in the AI space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding solutions to engineering challenges in the security space, primarily using Python and SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocating and consulting with other engineers on security best practices and secure-by-design methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining security data products such as SBOM, asset inventory, cloud infrastructure, and SIEM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring, logging, triaging and escalating cyber security threats, as well as documenting security events including IoC (Indicators of compromise).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting and collating security assessments through a variety of methods as appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating reports and working collaboratively with engineering teams to remediate identified issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing support and training for teams where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring to the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years work experience as a Security Analyst, Security Engineer, or in a similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in programming languages such as Java, Python, Go, and / or SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with AWS cloud platforms and particularly their security tools such as Security Hub, IAM, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of principles such as risk assessment, threat modelling, the OWASP Top 10, information security practices, and encryption theory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess a clear understanding of secure development best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous integration and deployment tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with Linux environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset, want to grow a business, and love working with a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using data to support and validate your concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a fast-paced work environment where everyday contributions have a big impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly diagnose and solve code problems, as well as help others unblock themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about sharing knowledge and mentoring teammates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary offered for this position is determined by several factors, including the applicant’s job-related skills, relevant experience, education or training, and work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, our total compensation package may include participation in variable cash bonus programs, equity, and a comprehensive range of health, welfare, and wellbeing benefits based on eligibility which are designated by role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruiter can provide more details about the specific salary/OTE range for your role during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Statement on Fair Employment and Equal Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EverQuote NI is committed to ensuring equal opportunity for all job applicants and employees. We will not discriminate on the grounds of religious belief, political opinion, race, gender (including gender reassignment), sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, pregnancy or maternity, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a registered employer in Northern Ireland, EverQuote NI complies with the Fair Employment and Treatment (Northern Ireland) Order 1998. As part of the application process, you will be asked to complete a fair employment monitoring form; this information is used solely for monitoring purposes and does not form part of the shortlisting or selection decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EverQuote NI carries out background checks on all candidates offered a position. A criminal record will not automatically disqualify you from working with EverQuote NI Limited; each case is considered

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:280}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;people’s lives in homes around the world. &lt;strong&gt;Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja&lt;/strong&gt;, the company has a proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of bringing disruptive innovation to market and developing one consumer product after another has allowed&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;to enter multiple product categories, driving significant growth and market share gains. Headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts with more than&amp;nbsp;4,100&amp;nbsp;associates, the company’s products are sold at key retailers, online and offline, and through distributors around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at SharkNinja &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SharkNinja, we’re building an AI-native culture. We’re not waiting for the future; we’re creating it. Our people are expected to experiment boldly, adopt new tools, and continuously raise what’s possible to create meaningful impact for our consumers. If you believe the best way to do your job hasn’t been invented yet, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manager, Media Analytics - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively impact people&#39;s lives in homes around the world. Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja, the company has a proven track record of bringing disruptive innovation to market, and developing one consumer product after another has allowed SharkNinja to enter multiple product categories, driving significant growth and market share gains. Headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts with more than 3,300+ associates, the company&#39;s products are sold at key retailers, online and offline, and through distributors around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t just make products. We identify and solve customer problems, some that customers don&#39;t even know they have. We tell that story via social, digital, broadcast, print, and retail media across organic, paid, influencer, and earned channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a Manager, Media Analytics to lead predictive measurement of our media investments across channels—building forward-looking models that anticipate performance, uncover insights, and fuel smarter, faster decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will join a growing Global Marketing Analytics Team, transforming data into clear actions that optimize marketing performance and guide media, social, and creative strategies. The ideal candidate will thrive in SharkNinja&#39;s fast-moving culture — balancing rigor with pragmatism and using predictive data not only to measure performance but to influence decisions and spark the next opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in London, UK and sits within our EMEA Marketing Analytics team, with primary responsibility for the UK market. While primarily supporting the UK, the role also provides analytical support to the Nordics and other emerging European markets as needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Predictive Modelling: &lt;/strong&gt;Build and maintain predictive and forecasting models—spanning MMM, attribution, and incrementality—to anticipate media performance and guide allocation decisions before results are final.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPI Measurement: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the metrics that matter, ensuring media activity is measured against clear goals and forecasted with increasing precision over time, and that agency partners are held accountable against these benchmarks through robust governance and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Channel Optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with internal teams and agencies to pivot strategies based on real-time insights and forward-looking model outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audience and Creative Effectiveness: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with internal teams and agencies to analyse audience and creative effectiveness across SharkNinja&#39;s product categories, leading with data-informed insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand &amp;amp; Talent Evaluation: &lt;/strong&gt;Monitor and report out on brand health and ambassador performance by analysing consumer sentiment data, ensuring celebrity investments align with SharkNinja&#39;s brand identity and drive measurable advertising lift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Signal Detection: &lt;/strong&gt;Proactively identify signals, anomalies, or emerging patterns in media and market data to flag risks or opportunities before they escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Dashboards: &lt;/strong&gt;Build and maintain concise, audience-appropriate dashboards that highlight what&#39;s working, what isn&#39;t, and where predictive models point next. Collaborate with Data &amp;amp; Engineering teams to maintain the integrity of the media analytics ecosystem, where data quality is validated, and dashboards provide accurate, actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insights to Action: &lt;/strong&gt;Translate complex, model-driven data into compelling stories that lead to concrete recommendations and immedi

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior IT Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Mobile Device Management (MDM) Tribe at HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;. As a senior individual contributor, you will play a key role in designing, optimizing, and evolving our endpoint management environment across &lt;strong&gt;macOS, Windows, and mobile platforms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring deep expertise in &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Intune, Jamf Pro&lt;/strong&gt; combined with a strong understanding of endpoint security, identity, automation, and modern device management practices. You will help shape our MDM strategy, drive technical improvements, and ensure a secure, scalable, and exceptional user experience.This is an &lt;strong&gt;Individual Contributor (IC)&lt;/strong&gt; role with a strong focus on technical ownership, architecture, automation, continuous improvement, and knowledge sharing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design&lt;/strong&gt;, implement, and continuously improve scalable MDM solutions across macOS, Windows, iOS, and Android, balancing security, compliance, and user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define&lt;/strong&gt; and maintain MDM standards, policies, configuration profiles, application management, and compliance controls aligned with HelloFresh security and business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage&lt;/strong&gt; PowerShell, Bash, and Microsoft Graph API to automate device management, compliance, reporting, remediation, and enforcement workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt; meaningful reporting and analytics to monitor device health, compliance, application status, security posture, and fleet trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactively&lt;/strong&gt; identify risks, dependencies, and opportunities for improvement, and drive structured solutions from problem definition through implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor&lt;/strong&gt; and coach team members, promote knowledge sharing, and contribute to cross-training and continuous improvement across the MDM Tribe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong enterprise MDM experience with deep hands-on and architectural expertise in Microsoft Intune and Jamf Pro/Jamf Connect across macOS, Windows, iOS, and Android.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Good understanding of endpoint architecture and the broader technology ecosystem, including Microsoft Entra ID, Apple Business Manager, Windows Autopilot, Conditional Access, EDR, Zscaler, and privilege management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience with PowerShell and Bash scripting and the ability to automate endpoint management, remediation, and operational processes using Microsoft Graph API.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of endpoint security principles, including encryption, compliance, device security, identity-driven access, and security controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder-management skills, with the ability to explain complex technical topics to audiences ranging from engineers to Directors and Senior Directors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;A collaborative and egoless mindset with a willingness to share knowledge, mentor colleagues, and contribute to the technical growth of the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
