&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Senior Project Manager experienced managing technical teams and releases across complex client environments required to join our Team!&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll encourage strong relationships with your team and have the ability to talk, at a technical level, with developers and senior technical team members (e.g., technical architects, solution architects etc). You will follow best practices in development standards and coding reviews through having a good understanding of branching strategies, development standards and coding reviews through having a good understanding of branching strategies, development principals and CI/CD.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Release and technical reporting regarding project/account technical deliverables, architecture and release pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management of project plans and detailed reporting to ensure efficient tracking of the project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RAID log management and escalation for the project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical risks and issues &amp;amp; provide mitigation options to achieve resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeably communicate with stakeholders (internal/external) including chairing technical meetings as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and co-ordinate Internal technical specialists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and inspire the team to achieve individual and team objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the technical team(s) complete what is expected of them successfully and suggest improvements to processes as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, plan, organise and manage the build of new infrastructure environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-ordinate high quality technical solutions, on time, via effective time management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help implement and benchmark the introduction of AI into SDLC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively run complex projects using Agile or Waterfall methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee releases across pre-production and production environments, demonstrating an understanding of dependencies between client systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement technical governance according to the client’s needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build customer confidence by understanding their needs &amp;amp; delivering first class solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and manage client expectations, addressing issues in a respectful and timely manner and ensuring the organisation maintains a positive image and provides a high-quality service&lt;/li&gt;
